      "notes": "This build works really well for Cyclops because you don’t need to stack a lot of damage items on him. What he really needs is cooldown reduction so he can keep spamming his skills, along with enough sustain to stay in fights longer.\n\nThis setup helps you stay in battle consistently and is also effective if you want to use Cyclops in the jungle. It performs well against burst heroes since you can outlast their damage, and it’s also reliable against sustain heroes because of your constant skill pressure.\n\nOverall, it focuses more on uptime and survivability rather than pure burst, which fits Cyclops’ playstyle really well.",
